# Deploy workflow

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/workflow-mac-1p-push-broker-deploy.md`.

- Implement on `cursor/<short-topic>`; do not commit app changes on `main`.
- Push the feature branch to `origin`; never push `main` from the agent.
- Use SSH remote `git@github.com:BlueMountainsIT/AS-dev-lab.git`.
- Tell the user the branch name and the Mac merge + `git push origin main` steps (1Password SSH → GitHub Actions → Vercel).
